iations that we observed  many of the hispanic population  non-contributor likelihood ratios that  we observed  we have sort of a standing hypothesis  that  our results have some pretty  considerable implications for cross  ancestry mixtures um and these are  currently  um underway uh being led by  students from the nicole debroski's lab  so the manuscript describing the  uh the data i presented today is  currently in review so i ask you to  patiently await the output from that  i do want to give a shout out to both  ashley and dr nabroski for  their tremendous support and initiative  in getting some of this data  you know really running instead of just  walking  so uh finally some acknowledgements um  again to dr navroski and her lab at the  university of toronto  who've been super supportive and working  really hard at getting some of these  projects  going dr hinda haned who is the creator  of the forensim r package  um ultimately we couldn't do the project  if the package didn't exist so  um hats off to her for putting this out  into the world  uh and finally dr rory rolfes and nico  caberio at sfsu  for really enthusiastic discussions over  the last year about the social and legal  implications of ancestry race and  ethnicity  on mixture interpretation i do  anticipate that many of these  discussions will form some hypotheses  for  some long-term future collaborative  efforts uh so finally  uh if there are questions i do encourage  you to reach out to myself  or dr navroski our contact information  is here  twitter um email website contacts those  are all fair game  um and finally finally um i did want to  put out the  special announcement that i am guest  editing  a special issue of genes titled source  attribution using forensic genomics  the deadline for this is excuse me  october 20th of this year if you do have  questions about submission  feel free to contact myself or any of  the editorial staff through the  manuscript submission system we will  hopefully  get you rocking and rolling as soon as  possible  and i appreciate your consideration for  submitting to us  and with that i don't think i can in  person take any questions unless it's  via email  absolutely entertain the option for  questions through either  endeavor and that is all i thank you for  your attention
 

